<title>SWITZERLAND: Elektrowatt,Bayernwerk Amata stake.</title>
<headline>Elektrowatt,Bayernwerk Amata stake.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elektrwatt Engineering, a unit of the Swiss Elektrowatt group, said it and Germany's Bayernwerk had acquired a 48 percent stake in Amata Power, a Thai energy company. Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>It marked consulting company Elektrowatt Engineering's first such direct investment, it said in a statement. It will provide engineering know-how, while Bayernwerk is in charge of operating power generation facilities.</p>
<p>Amata Power specialises in producing and operating power generators in industrial parks, it said.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
